"The data container should be created by :meth:`pygmt.clib.Session."
"create_data`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.14/site-packages/pygmt/clib/session.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.clib.session.Session.write_data:6
msgid ""
"Wraps ``GMT_Write_Data`` but only allows writing to a file. So the "
"``method`` argument is omitted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api/generated/pygmt.clib.Session.write_data.rst:0
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.14/site-packages/pygmt/clib/session.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.clib.session.Session.write_data:10
msgid ""
"A valid GMT data family name (e.g., ``'GMT_IS_DATASET'``). See the "
"``FAMILIES`` attribute for valid names. Don't use the ``GMT_VIA_VECTOR`` or "
"``GMT_VIA_MATRIX`` constructs for this. Use ``GMT_IS_VECTOR`` and "
"``GMT_IS_MATRIX`` instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.14/site-packages/pygmt/clib/session.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.clib.session.Session.write_data:16
msgid ""
"A valid GMT data geometry name (e.g., ``'GMT_IS_POINT'``). See the "
"``GEOMETRIES`` attribute for valid names."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.14/site-packages/pygmt/clib/session.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.clib.session.Session.write_data:20
msgid ""
"How the data is to be written to the file. This option varies depending on "
"the given family. See the GMT API documentation for details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.14/site-packages/pygmt/clib/session.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.clib.session.Session.write_data:25
msgid "[xmin, xmax, ymin, ymax, zmin, zmax] of the data. Must have 6 elements."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.14/site-packages/pygmt/clib/session.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.clib.session.Session.write_data:29
